    "Cost": 17786241,
    "UIName": "Warhawk 'Sanctimonialis Canis'",
    "Id": "mechdef_warhawk_WHK-AN",
    "Name": "Warhawk Prime",
    "Details": "The personal OmniMech of Star Colonel Anwen, this Warhawk shows the warrior's penchant for energy-based weapons may have given way to an obsession. Beginning with its primary weapons array, this Warhawk boasts four ER Large Lasers. Another grouping of energy weapons make up Anwen's secondary weapons system, a pair of Medium Pulse Lasers mounted on the 'Mech's center torso. Furthermore, one ER Medium Laser and one ER Small Laser offer even more added damage potential. Anwen kept the Warhawk’s integrated targeting computer, but had to make some modifications to allow for an increased weapons load. Mounting only energy-weapons makes heat dissipation a primary concern. In an attempt to solve the problem, Blood Spirit technicians equipped the 'Mech with 26 high efficiency heat sinks.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Targeting - Long</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.18</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_warhawk"
  },
